        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    cash_flows = [50, 50, 50, 50, 1050]\n    discount_rate = 0.04\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    present_values = [\n        cash_flow / ((1 + discount_rate) ** period)\n        for period, cash_flow in enumerate(cash_flows, 1)\n    ]\n    bond_price = sum(present_values)\n\n    macaulay_duration = sum(\n        period * present_value / bond_price\n        for period, present_value in enumerate(present_values, 1)\n    )\n\n    # Return answer rounded to two decimal places\n    return round(macaulay_duration, 2)\n```",
